      "content": "Previous NetZoo goal: Previous NetZoo goal: I'd like GIRAFFE to estimate TF activity per sample for 24 mouse kidney samples. I have a gene-by-sample expression table with gene IDs in the first column and a header, a TF-to-gene motif edge list and a TF-TF PPI list. I'm not sure whether the libraries were stranded or unstranded, if that matters.\nUser follow-up: TF activity for each of the 24 kidney samples with GIRAFFE.\nUser follow-up: TF activity for each of the 24 kidney samples with GIRAFFE."
